      "source_summary": {
        "content": "Based on the recent reliability metrics showing only 78.2% on-time performance and 12 major delay events in the past month, the disruption impact on Line 7 is severe, making the signaling system upgrade urgently necessary. The severe disruption metrics confirm the signaling system replacement is critically urgent. However, Goal 2 requires manual processing: the vendor contract tool lacks a 'signaling system' option, and the budget approval tool needs missing parameters like projectID and approverID. Please handle this contract manually given the urgency. To proceed with passenger communication ... [middle omitted] ... airs for alternative route planning. 3. Notification details—channel (SMS/email/app push), target audience, and message content. Note: Bulk refunds require unavailable parameters (incidentId, affectedTrips, refundPercentage, financeApproval); manual processing is recommended.",
        "role": "agent"
      }
    },
